Z||000004||StuGood||12-28-2000||01:57 PM||||Worked like a charm      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Thanks, guys!<P>Seems all of the photos of my own cars (that I can find) are all bitmap files (.bmp's)... so converted this one to ".jpg" format, and... presto!  This is my 1986 SE V6 4-speed...   <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1986GoldSE_StuGood_1.jpg">    <P>Thanks again, Cliff     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> !<BR><p>[This message has been edited by StuGood (edited 12-29-2000).]||||reg||14
